Z||000008||Alex4mula||06-08-2000||09:52 AM||||The word "FIT" could be very subjective. I heard the TransAm/Camaro Flowmaster is much longer than the stock Fiero. "Much" meaning 15" or 16" versus the 12" for the fiero. Yeah, it will fit but very tight with the pipe out bend starting right from the muffler and modification to all the hangers. A photo side by side of the two will be great. There are many of us waiting for the right info on this. I know all will appreciate you sharing it with us. Especially me :-)||||reg||1
